     * partial match: (e.g., "foo.com" == "baz.foo.com" and ".foo.com" ==
     * "baz.foo.com", but ".foo.com" != "foo.com").
     *
     * Areas are matched in the following cases:
     * 1. "*" (without quotes) always matches any hosts.
